{
  "uid": "circle-be-jobs",
  "title": "circle_be — Jobs, Queues & Datastores",
  "tags": [
    "circle_be",
    "jobs",
    "outbox",
    "datastores"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "定时任务 · Scheduled jobs",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "任务心跳滞后（× 预期周期）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(time() - max by (job) (circle_cron_last_success_timestamp_seconds)) / max by (job) (circle_cron_interval_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "以各任务自己的预期周期归一化，所以每分钟任务和每天 4 点的任务能画在同一张图上。1.0 = 迟了一个周期；红线 3.0 = CronJobStalled 的告警阈值。\n\n心跳在进程启动时就播种，所以从没跑过的任务会从 0 开始持续爬升，而不是因为序列不存在而完全看不见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "任务失败率（15m）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(circle_cron_runs_total{result=\"failure\"}[15m])) / sum by (job) (rate(circle_cron_runs_total[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "注意：4 个 outbox 处理器会自己 catch 异常并写进行上的 lastError，所以队列堵死时这张图可能一直是 0 —— 那种故障要看下面的积压和死信。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "任务单次耗时",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (job) (circle_cron_last_duration_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "逼近自身周期就意味着下一轮会与本轮重叠（多数任务有重入闸，会直接跳过）。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "任务执行速率（15m）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(circle_cron_runs_total[15m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "次/分钟。掉到 0 而心跳不涨 = 调度器停了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Outbox 队列 · 「活干不完」与「已放弃」",
      "collapsed": false,
